n-capmkt:RelationshipWithTheListedEntity><in-capmkt:WhetherEventOrInformationIsAnOutcomeOfBoardMeeting contextRef="MainD">true</in-capmkt:WhetherEventOrInformationIsAnOutcomeOfBoardMeeting><in-capmkt:DateOfBoardMeeting contextRef="MainD">2026-10-27</in-capmkt:DateOfBoardMeeting><in-capmkt:StartTimeOfBoardMeeting contextRef="MainD">11:30:00</in-capmkt:StartTimeOfBoardMeeting><in-capmkt:EndTimeOfBoardMeeting contextRef="MainD">16:30:00</in-capmkt:EndTimeOfBoardMeeting><in-capmkt:NumberOfPersonsOrEntitiesForWhomChangeIsBeingReported contextRef="MainI" unitRef="pure" decimals="0">2</in-capmkt:NumberOfPersonsOrEntitiesForWhomChangeIsBeingReported><in-capmkt:DateOfReport contextRef="MainI">2026-10-27</in-capmkt:DateOfReport><in-capmkt:TypeOfChange contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">Appointment</in-capmkt:TypeOfChange><in-capmkt:CategoryForChange contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">Key Managerial Personnel</in-capmkt:CategoryForChange><in-capmkt:DesignationOfDesignatedPerson contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">Chief Financial Officer</in-capmkt:DesignationOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:SalutationOfDesignatedPerson contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">Mr.</in-capmkt:SalutationOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:NameOfDesignatedPerson contextRef="I_ChangeInManagement1">Akshit Choudhary</in-capmkt:NameOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:EffectiveDateOfReasonOfChange contextRef="I_ChangeInManagement1">2026-11-01</in-capmkt:EffectiveDateOfReasonOfChange><in-capmkt:BriefProfile contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">Mr. Akshit Choudhary is a Chartered Accountant with over 15 years of professional experience across banking, financial services, auditing, treasury, and business operations. His professional journey includes stints with the Punjab &amp; Sind Bank, PwC SDC and State Bank of India. He brings diverse experience across multiple functional domains, including Audit &amp; Assurance, Integrated Treasury, Branch Manager, and Regional Manager. His exposure to both frontline business operations and Head Office functions provides him with a comprehensive understanding of banking, financial management, risk, and organizational performance. Having worked across more than 5 geographies, he has developed valuable insights into diverse markets, regional business dynamics, and the opportunities and challenges associated with different operating environments. Apart from being a C.A, he holds a B.Com. (Hons.) degree, with additional qualifications including CAIIB and a Diploma in Treasury, Investment and Risk Management. He has also participated in several leadership development programmes including the Board Leadership Programme conducted by Goldsmiths, University of London, in collaboration with MDI. His combination of financial expertise, treasury experience, operational leadership, and cross-geographical exposure provides a strong foundation for contributing to strategic financial management, capital planning, risk governance, and sustainable institutional growth.
